  "description": "A debugger for the .NET runtime (VSCode Debug Adapter Protocol, GDB/MI and CLI), packaged as android-arm64 native binaries that run ON an Android device (ABI arm64-v8a) to debug .NET 11 CoreCLR Android apps. On build, the on-device payload is copied into the consuming application's output folder (netcoredbg-android-arm64/ subfolder), ready to be pushed to a device with adb and driven over an adb-forwarded port. Contains no managed library and adds no NuGet dependencies.",
